  "host_scope": "same_host",
  "description": "Puts each command an AI agent ran (Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, Copilot, Roo/Kilo/Cline: the agent's own session record, with the program the command started) beside what Windows recorded of that program: Prefetch runs, BAM, Security 4688, AmCache and ShimCache presence, SRUM runtime. The agent's record says it asked; Windows' records say the program ran.",
  "proves": "A program an AI agent asked for, and Windows' own record that it ran, minutes apart",
  "narrative": "{ai_steps.agent} ran `{ai_steps.command}` at {ai_steps.timestamp} in session '{ai_steps.session_name}', ordered by {ai_steps.ordered_by}. Windows' records of {executable_name} in the same window: {records} records from {feathers}, between {first_time} and {last_time}.",
  "author": "Crow-Eye Team",
